WEBVTT

00:18:58.731 --> 00:19:01.888
and once they're there,
why would I want to go anywhere else?

00:19:01.912 --> 00:19:03.459
It's also helpful for motivating

00:19:03.483 --> 00:19:05.515
and connecting and coordinating people,

00:19:05.539 --> 00:19:08.893
because they feel like they're in a place
that has distinctive values,

00:19:08.917 --> 00:19:11.265
and they start to identify
with those values.

00:19:11.289 --> 00:19:14.740
I worry a lot about the dark side
of strong cultures though,

00:19:14.764 --> 00:19:17.031
which is that they tend
to breed homogeneity,

00:19:17.055 --> 00:19:19.467
that can cause groupthink,

00:19:19.491 --> 00:19:23.006
in a lot of cases they have
trouble changing and adapting

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:24.514
because people are so committed

00:19:24.538 --> 00:19:26.323
to the way we have always done things

00:19:26.347 --> 00:19:28.308
or the values we've always held.

00:19:28.332 --> 00:19:30.592
Did you see any of those sharper edges?